[
  {
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 14.654,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.154,
    "end": 24.08,
    "text": "Before anything else, let your body arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.08,
    "end": 38.817,
    "text": "Find a position where you can be still, sitting or lying down."
  },
  {
    "start": 45.317,
    "end": 48.011,
    "text": "Whatever lets you stop holding yourself up."
  },
  {
    "start": 54.511,
    "end": 57.112,
    "text": "Close your eyes when they're ready."
  },
  {
    "start": 67.112,
    "end": 69.965,
    "text": "Take a breath in, slow and full."
  },
  {
    "start": 73.565,
    "end": 75.33,
    "text": "And let it pour out of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 81.83,
    "end": 82.702,
    "text": "Again."
  },
  {
    "start": 85.102,
    "end": 86.309,
    "text": "Breathing in."
  },
  {
    "start": 89.909,
    "end": 93.93,
    "text": "And breathing out, letting your weight increase."
  },
  {
    "start": 100.43,
    "end": 101.405,
    "text": "One more."
  },
  {
    "start": 103.805,
    "end": 105.152,
    "text": "All the way in."
  },
  {
    "start": 108.752,
    "end": 110.285,
    "text": "And all the way out."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.785,
    "end": 117.621,
    "text": "Good."
  },
  {
    "start": 120.021,
    "end": 123.086,
    "text": "Let the breath go back to its own rhythm now."
  },
  {
    "start": 129.586,
    "end": 131.444,
    "text": "You've done enough directing."
  },
  {
    "start": 137.944,
    "end": 140.049,
    "text": "Your body knows what to do."
  },
  {
    "start": 146.549,
    "end": 150.543,
    "text": "Feel the places where your body meets the surface beneath you."
  },
  {
    "start": 152.943,
    "end": 154.104,
    "text": "Your back."
  },
  {
    "start": 156.504,
    "end": 157.851,
    "text": "Your shoulders."
  },
  {
    "start": 160.251,
    "end": 161.308,
    "text": "Your hips."
  },
  {
    "start": 163.708,
    "end": 165.564,
    "text": "The backs of your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 172.064,
    "end": 174.99,
    "text": "Let yourself be held by what's underneath you."
  },
  {
    "start": 177.39,
    "end": 179.758,
    "text": "You can stop supporting yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 182.158,
    "end": 184.496,
    "text": "The ground is already doing that."
  },
  {
    "start": 190.996,
    "end": 193.411,
    "text": "Now bring your attention to your face."
  },
  {
    "start": 195.811,
    "end": 197.158,
    "text": "Your forehead."
  },
  {
    "start": 199.558,
    "end": 200.998,
    "text": "Let it smooth."
  },
  {
    "start": 203.398,
    "end": 204.433,
    "text": "Your eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": 206.833,
    "end": 209.573,
    "text": "Let them sink back into their softness."
  },
  {
    "start": 211.973,
    "end": 213.877,
    "text": "Feel your jaw loosening."
  },
  {
    "start": 223.877,
    "end": 226.013,
    "text": "Allow your shoulders to relax."
  },
  {
    "start": 236.013,
    "end": 237.184,
    "text": "Your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 239.584,
    "end": 240.838,
    "text": "Let it widen."
  },
  {
    "start": 243.238,
    "end": 244.399,
    "text": "Your ribs."
  },
  {
    "start": 246.799,
    "end": 249.214,
    "text": "Let them expand with each breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 259.214,
    "end": 260.375,
    "text": "Your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 262.775,
    "end": 264.029,
    "text": "Let them open."
  },
  {
    "start": 274.029,
    "end": 276.119,
    "text": "Notice your hands right now."
  },
  {
    "start": 278.519,
    "end": 279.866,
    "text": "Are they curled?"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.266,
    "end": 283.334,
    "text": "Clenched?"
  },
  {
    "start": 285.734,
    "end": 286.891,
    "text": "Half closed?"
  },
  {
    "start": 293.391,
    "end": 295.249,
    "text": "Let them open all the way."
  },
  {
    "start": 297.649,
    "end": 300.389,
    "text": "Palms up, if that feels comfortable."
  },
  {
    "start": 302.789,
    "end": 304.832,
    "text": "Fingers soft and apart."
  },
  {
    "start": 311.332,
    "end": 313.654,
    "text": "This is the posture of receiving."
  },
  {
    "start": 316.054,
    "end": 317.958,
    "text": "Your body already knows it."
  },
  {
    "start": 320.358,
    "end": 323.562,
    "text": "It's been waiting for permission to return to it."
  },
  {
    "start": 333.562,
    "end": 336.999,
    "text": "Stay with the openness in your hands for a moment."
  },
  {
    "start": 339.399,
    "end": 342.0,
    "text": "Feel the air against your palms."
  },
  {
    "start": 344.4,
    "end": 347.465,
    "text": "The small warmth that begins to gather there."
  },
  {
    "start": 353.965,
    "end": 356.241,
    "text": "This is where we begin tonight."
  },
  {
    "start": 358.641,
    "end": 359.988,
    "text": "Not with ideas."
  },
  {
    "start": 362.388,
    "end": 363.648,
    "text": "With the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 366.048,
    "end": 367.395,
    "text": "With the hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 369.795,
    "end": 372.21,
    "text": "With what it feels like to be open."
  },
  {
    "start": 382.21,
    "end": 384.857,
    "text": "There is a pattern that most of us carry."
  },
  {
    "start": 387.257,
    "end": 390.554,
    "text": "It lives so deep that we mistake it for who we are."
  },
  {
    "start": 397.054,
    "end": 400.026,
    "text": "It's the feeling that there is not quite enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 402.426,
    "end": 403.726,
    "text": "Not enough time."
  },
  {
    "start": 406.126,
    "end": 407.473,
    "text": "Not enough rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 409.873,
    "end": 411.406,
    "text": "Not enough coming in."
  },
  {
    "start": 413.806,
    "end": 418.45,
    "text": "A quiet hum of lack, running underneath everything."
  },
  {
    "start": 424.95,
    "end": 426.854,
    "text": "You might not even call it that."
  },
  {
    "start": 429.254,
    "end": 432.969,
    "text": "It might show up as tension when you check your bank account."
  },
  {
    "start": 435.369,
    "end": 439.641,
    "text": "As a tightness in your chest when someone talks about success."
  },
  {
    "start": 442.041,
    "end": 445.304,
    "text": "As a reflexive need to hold on to what you have,"
  },
  {
    "start": 447.704,
    "end": 451.512,
    "text": "because some part of you believes there will not be more."
  },
  {
    "start": 458.012,
    "end": 460.102,
    "text": "This is not a flaw in you."
  },
  {
    "start": 462.502,
    "end": 464.634,
    "text": "This is a pattern you inherited."
  },
  {
    "start": 467.034,
    "end": 469.867,
    "text": "A survival strategy that was handed down."
  },
  {
    "start": 472.267,
    "end": 475.332,
    "text": "Probably before you had the words to question it."
  },
  {
    "start": 481.832,
    "end": 485.51,
    "text": "Someone you loved, early on, carried this pattern."
  },
  {
    "start": 487.91,
    "end": 492.043,
    "text": "Maybe it was a parent who worked themselves empty and still worried."
  },
  {
    "start": 494.443,
    "end": 500.601,
    "text": "Maybe it was the unspoken rule in your household that wanting more was dangerous."
  },
  {
    "start": 503.001,
    "end": 504.023,
    "text": "Greedy."
  },
  {
    "start": 506.423,
    "end": 507.584,
    "text": "Ungrateful."
  },
  {
    "start": 514.084,
    "end": 516.267,
    "text": "Maybe no one said it out loud."
  },
  {
    "start": 518.667,
    "end": 519.967,
    "text": "But you felt it."
  },
  {
    "start": 522.367,
    "end": 524.689,
    "text": "In the way money was discussed."
  },
  {
    "start": 527.089,
    "end": 528.296,
    "text": "Or avoided."
  },
  {
    "start": 530.696,
    "end": 532.043,
    "text": "Or fought about."
  },
  {
    "start": 538.543,
    "end": 544.37,
    "text": "And your nervous system, young and brilliant, did what it always does."
  },
  {
    "start": 546.77,
    "end": 547.931,
    "text": "It learned."
  },
  {
    "start": 550.331,
    "end": 551.613,
    "text": "It adapted."
  },
  {
    "start": 554.013,
    "end": 556.614,
    "text": "It built a belief to keep you safe."
  },
  {
    "start": 563.114,
    "end": 567.572,
    "text": "That belief might sound like: there is never enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 569.972,
    "end": 572.944,
    "text": "Or: I have to earn every good thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 575.344,
    "end": 579.245,
    "text": "Or: if I have too much, something bad will happen."
  },
  {
    "start": 581.645,
    "end": 585.592,
    "text": "Or: people like me are not the ones who get to have it easy."
  },
  {
    "start": 592.092,
    "end": 596.179,
    "text": "Notice if any of those landed somewhere in your body right now."
  },
  {
    "start": 606.179,
    "end": 607.758,
    "text": "Where did you feel it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 610.158,
    "end": 611.458,
    "text": "Your chest?"
  },
  {
    "start": 613.858,
    "end": 614.906,
    "text": "Your throat?"
  },
  {
    "start": 617.306,
    "end": 618.467,
    "text": "Your stomach?"
  },
  {
    "start": 624.967,
    "end": 626.843,
    "text": "Breathe into that place."
  },
  {
    "start": 629.243,
    "end": 630.265,
    "text": "Slowly."
  },
  {
    "start": 632.665,
    "end": 633.965,
    "text": "Not to fix it."
  },
  {
    "start": 636.365,
    "end": 637.526,
    "text": "To meet it."
  },
  {
    "start": 644.026,
    "end": 648.126,
    "text": "That tightness, that contraction, is not yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 650.526,
    "end": 652.059,
    "text": "It was given to you."
  },
  {
    "start": 654.459,
    "end": 657.06,
    "text": "It was installed before you could choose."
  },
  {
    "start": 659.46,
    "end": 662.479,
    "text": "And it has been running in the background ever since."
  },
  {
    "start": 664.879,
    "end": 666.737,
    "text": "Shaping what you reach for."
  },
  {
    "start": 669.137,
    "end": 671.598,
    "text": "Shaping what you allow yourself to have."
  },
  {
    "start": 673.998,
    "end": 676.32,
    "text": "Shaping what you think you deserve."
  },
  {
    "start": 682.82,
    "end": 687.228,
    "text": "But here is what's true, and what your body already knows."
  },
  {
    "start": 693.728,
    "end": 697.206,
    "text": "That pattern was never the truth about the world."
  },
  {
    "start": 699.606,
    "end": 702.445,
    "text": "It was one family's way of surviving."
  },
  {
    "start": 704.845,
    "end": 706.052,
    "text": "And it worked."
  },
  {
    "start": 708.452,
    "end": 709.892,
    "text": "It got them through."
  },
  {
    "start": 712.292,
    "end": 713.639,
    "text": "It got you here."
  },
  {
    "start": 720.139,
    "end": 722.879,
    "text": "But it is not yours to carry forward."
  },
  {
    "start": 729.379,
    "end": 731.933,
    "text": "So right now, I want you to do something."
  },
  {
    "start": 738.433,
    "end": 744.935,
    "text": "Imagine that pattern, that old belief, as something you've been holding."
  },
  {
    "start": 747.335,
    "end": 749.889,
    "text": "A heavy, worn object in your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 752.289,
    "end": 753.682,
    "text": "Maybe a stone."
  },
  {
    "start": 756.082,
    "end": 757.754,
    "text": "Maybe a locked box."
  },
  {
    "start": 760.154,
    "end": 762.848,
    "text": "Maybe a fist you've been making for years."
  },
  {
    "start": 769.348,
    "end": 770.695,
    "text": "Feel its weight."
  },
  {
    "start": 773.095,
    "end": 775.556,
    "text": "Feel how long you've been gripping it."
  },
  {
    "start": 777.956,
    "end": 782.649,
    "text": "Feel the fatigue in your fingers, your forearms, your shoulders."
  },
  {
    "start": 785.049,
    "end": 786.349,
    "text": "All that effort,"
  },
  {
    "start": 788.749,
    "end": 792.929,
    "text": "spent holding on to something that was never yours to begin with."
  },
  {
    "start": 799.429,
    "end": 802.494,
    "text": "Now, slowly, begin to open your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 812.494,
    "end": 814.073,
    "text": "Not throwing it away."
  },
  {
    "start": 816.473,
    "end": 817.913,
    "text": "Not rejecting it."
  },
  {
    "start": 820.313,
    "end": 821.639,
    "text": "Placing it down."
  },
  {
    "start": 824.039,
    "end": 824.897,
    "text": "Gently."
  },
  {
    "start": 831.397,
    "end": 832.558,
    "text": "Thanking it."
  },
  {
    "start": 834.958,
    "end": 836.816,
    "text": "It kept you safe once."
  },
  {
    "start": 839.216,
    "end": 843.674,
    "text": "It taught you to be careful, to be watchful, to be smart."
  },
  {
    "start": 846.074,
    "end": 849.025,
    "text": "And now you are safe enough to let it rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 855.525,
    "end": 858.451,
    "text": "Feel your hands lighten as you let go."
  },
  {
    "start": 868.451,
    "end": 870.494,
    "text": "Feel the relief in your arms."
  },
  {
    "start": 872.894,
    "end": 874.241,
    "text": "Your shoulders."
  },
  {
    "start": 876.641,
    "end": 877.812,
    "text": "Your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 884.312,
    "end": 886.309,
    "text": "Something is already different."
  },
  {
    "start": 888.709,
    "end": 891.449,
    "text": "Something in you has already changed shape."
  },
  {
    "start": 901.449,
    "end": 907.886,
    "text": "Now, with your hands still open, I want you to notice what's available."
  },
  {
    "start": 917.886,
    "end": 923.293,
    "text": "When the grip loosens, when the bracing stops, there is space."
  },
  {
    "start": 925.693,
    "end": 931.173,
    "text": "Space you've never had before, because the old pattern was filling it."
  },
  {
    "start": 937.673,
    "end": 941.713,
    "text": "And into that space, something can arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": 948.213,
    "end": 951.789,
    "text": "Imagine, right now, that your open hands can receive."
  },
  {
    "start": 954.189,
    "end": 955.861,
    "text": "Not because you earned it."
  },
  {
    "start": 958.261,
    "end": 960.629,
    "text": "Not because you proved you're worthy."
  },
  {
    "start": 963.029,
    "end": 965.741,
    "text": "Because receiving is your natural state."
  },
  {
    "start": 968.141,
    "end": 970.37,
    "text": "You were born with open hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 972.77,
    "end": 974.442,
    "text": "The fist came later."
  },
  {
    "start": 980.942,
    "end": 985.354,
    "text": "Feel what it's like to sit here, with nothing to grip."
  },
  {
    "start": 987.754,
    "end": 989.194,
    "text": "With nothing to guard."
  },
  {
    "start": 991.594,
    "end": 993.074,
    "text": "With nothing to earn."
  },
  {
    "start": 999.574,
    "end": 1001.107,
    "text": "Your hands open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1003.507,
    "end": 1005.179,
    "text": "Your chest wide."
  },
  {
    "start": 1007.579,
    "end": 1009.297,
    "text": "Your breathing easy."
  },
  {
    "start": 1015.797,
    "end": 1019.333,
    "text": "This is the posture of someone who knows there is enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 1025.833,
    "end": 1028.852,
    "text": "Say this, silently, inside yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 1038.852,
    "end": 1041.22,
    "text": "I am allowed to have a good life."
  },
  {
    "start": 1051.22,
    "end": 1053.821,
    "text": "I am allowed to have more than enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 1063.821,
    "end": 1068.465,
    "text": "I release the belief that I have to struggle to deserve what I need."
  },
  {
    "start": 1078.465,
    "end": 1081.53,
    "text": "What I need is already on its way to me."
  },
  {
    "start": 1091.53,
    "end": 1093.155,
    "text": "I do not have to chase it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1095.555,
    "end": 1097.552,
    "text": "I do not have to beg for it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1104.052,
    "end": 1106.978,
    "text": "I can open my hands and let it arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": 1116.978,
    "end": 1120.229,
    "text": "Feel those words in your body, not your mind."
  },
  {
    "start": 1130.229,
    "end": 1132.04,
    "text": "Feel them in your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 1134.44,
    "end": 1135.601,
    "text": "Your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 1138.001,
    "end": 1139.818,
    "text": "The base of your spine."
  },
  {
    "start": 1146.318,
    "end": 1151.566,
    "text": "Let them settle like warm water into the places that have been dry."
  },
  {
    "start": 1161.566,
    "end": 1165.699,
    "text": "Now imagine yourself moving through an ordinary day."
  },
  {
    "start": 1168.099,
    "end": 1170.049,
    "text": "Tomorrow, or next week."
  },
  {
    "start": 1176.549,
    "end": 1178.435,
    "text": "But something is different."
  },
  {
    "start": 1184.935,
    "end": 1189.486,
    "text": "You check your accounts, and your chest stays open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1195.986,
    "end": 1198.308,
    "text": "Someone mentions an opportunity,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1200.708,
    "end": 1203.216,
    "text": "and instead of the old voice saying"
  },
  {
    "start": 1205.616,
    "end": 1207.652,
    "text": "\"that's not for people like you,\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1210.052,
    "end": 1211.817,
    "text": "there is curiosity."
  },
  {
    "start": 1214.217,
    "end": 1215.239,
    "text": "Interest."
  },
  {
    "start": 1217.639,
    "end": 1218.893,
    "text": "A quiet yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1225.393,
    "end": 1228.341,
    "text": "You spend, and there is no panic."
  },
  {
    "start": 1230.741,
    "end": 1232.911,
    "text": "Because you know more is coming."
  },
  {
    "start": 1235.311,
    "end": 1237.169,
    "text": "Not from magical thinking."
  },
  {
    "start": 1239.569,
    "end": 1244.306,
    "text": "From the deep, settled knowing that you are someone who receives."
  },
  {
    "start": 1250.806,
    "end": 1254.01,
    "text": "You negotiate, and your voice is steady."
  },
  {
    "start": 1256.41,
    "end": 1260.729,
    "text": "You ask for what your work is worth, and you do not flinch."
  },
  {
    "start": 1263.129,
    "end": 1267.216,
    "text": "Because the old story about being grateful for whatever you get"
  },
  {
    "start": 1269.616,
    "end": 1271.238,
    "text": "has been set down."
  },
  {
    "start": 1277.738,
    "end": 1282.15,
    "text": "You notice generosity moving through you more easily."
  },
  {
    "start": 1284.55,
    "end": 1289.791,
    "text": "Because when you know there is enough, giving becomes effortless."
  },
  {
    "start": 1292.191,
    "end": 1296.603,
    "text": "When the tap is open, the water flows in both directions."
  },
  {
    "start": 1303.103,
    "end": 1305.053,
    "text": "See that version of yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 1307.453,
    "end": 1309.171,
    "text": "Walking a little taller."
  },
  {
    "start": 1311.571,
    "end": 1312.918,
    "text": "Shoulders back."
  },
  {
    "start": 1315.318,
    "end": 1316.943,
    "text": "Hands unclenched."
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.343,
    "end": 1323.941,
    "text": "Moving through the world as someone who belongs in every room they enter."
  },
  {
    "start": 1330.441,
    "end": 1332.162,
    "text": "That is not a fantasy."
  },
  {
    "start": 1334.562,
    "end": 1340.123,
    "text": "That is the version of you that exists when the old pattern stops running."
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.523,
    "end": 1347.585,
    "text": "And you are already closer to that person than you were twenty minutes ago."
  },
  {
    "start": 1357.585,
    "end": 1359.35,
    "text": "Let that image dissolve now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1361.75,
    "end": 1363.84,
    "text": "Let it sink into your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 1366.24,
    "end": 1368.19,
    "text": "Your cells are absorbing it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1370.59,
    "end": 1373.191,
    "text": "Your nervous system is recalibrating."
  },
  {
    "start": 1379.691,
    "end": 1381.646,
    "text": "There is nothing else to do."
  },
  {
    "start": 1384.046,
    "end": 1386.182,
    "text": "This is already taking effect."
  },
  {
    "start": 1392.682,
    "end": 1395.36,
    "text": "Bring your attention back to your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 1397.76,
    "end": 1399.014,
    "text": "Still open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1401.414,
    "end": 1402.854,
    "text": "Still soft."
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.354,
    "end": 1416.413,
    "text": "Every time you notice your hands today, tomorrow, this week, you'll remember this feeling."
  },
  {
    "start": 1422.913,
    "end": 1424.12,
    "text": "Open hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 1426.52,
    "end": 1427.635,
    "text": "Open life."
  },
  {
    "start": 1430.035,
    "end": 1431.939,
    "text": "It's that straightforward."
  },
  {
    "start": 1441.939,
    "end": 1444.11,
    "text": "Breathing in, receiving."
  },
  {
    "start": 1450.61,
    "end": 1454.203,
    "text": "Breathing out, letting go of the old story."
  },
  {
    "start": 1460.703,
    "end": 1463.065,
    "text": "Breathing in, fullness."
  },
  {
    "start": 1469.565,
    "end": 1471.649,
    "text": "Breathing out, ease."
  },
  {
    "start": 1478.149,
    "end": 1480.005,
    "text": "Breathing in, trust."
  },
  {
    "start": 1486.505,
    "end": 1488.997,
    "text": "Breathing out, arrival."
  },
  {
    "start": 1498.997,
    "end": 1503.084,
    "text": "Gently now, begin to feel the room around you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1509.584,
    "end": 1511.813,
    "text": "The surface beneath your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 1514.213,
    "end": 1516.071,
    "text": "The temperature of the air."
  },
  {
    "start": 1518.471,
    "end": 1521.35,
    "text": "The sounds, near and far."
  },
  {
    "start": 1527.85,
    "end": 1529.429,
    "text": "Wiggle your fingers."
  },
  {
    "start": 1531.829,
    "end": 1532.851,
    "text": "Slowly."
  },
  {
    "start": 1539.351,
    "end": 1540.698,
    "text": "Your toes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1547.198,
    "end": 1549.334,
    "text": "Take a deep, full breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 1559.334,
    "end": 1561.842,
    "text": "And a slow, easy exhale."
  },
  {
    "start": 1568.342,
    "end": 1571.267,
    "text": "Roll your head gently, if that feels right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1581.267,
    "end": 1585.725,
    "text": "Stretch your arms, or whatever movement your body asks for."
  },
  {
    "start": 1595.725,
    "end": 1598.79,
    "text": "And when you're ready, let your eyes open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1605.29,
    "end": 1606.497,
    "text": "Take your time."
  },
  {
    "start": 1608.897,
    "end": 1610.379,
    "text": "There is no rush."
  },
  {
    "start": 1616.879,
    "end": 1618.458,
    "text": "Something has shifted."
  },
  {
    "start": 1620.858,
    "end": 1623.041,
    "text": "You may not have words for it yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1625.441,
    "end": 1627.066,
    "text": "You do not need words."
  },
  {
    "start": 1629.466,
    "end": 1631.091,
    "text": "Your body knows."
  },
  {
    "start": 1637.591,
    "end": 1639.997,
    "text": "The old pattern is lighter now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1642.397,
    "end": 1647.877,
    "text": "Every time you return to this practice, it will loosen a little more."
  },
  {
    "start": 1650.277,
    "end": 1653.11,
    "text": "Until one day you notice that it's gone,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1655.51,
    "end": 1658.018,
    "text": "and you can't quite remember when it left."
  },
  {
    "start": 1664.518,
    "end": 1666.041,
    "text": "Your hands are open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1668.441,
    "end": 1670.044,
    "text": "Your life is open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1676.544,
    "end": 1677.825,
    "text": "Carry that with you."
  }
]
